t least once each calendar quarter to a participant or beneficiary who has the right to direct the investment of assets in his or her account under the plan,\\n\\n(ii) at least once each calendar year to a participant or beneficiary who has his or her own account under the plan but does not have the right to direct the investment of assets in that account, and\",\"start\":290},{\"end\":245,\"field\":\"actor\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A9ede50be3469932d071153987e9d2b399c510cf2e3db7e8c7c8f05bf5e359184:102:245:sha256-77aa98ae2f60d724e2cafa6146d88c149690841268ab526fe2219ab08a903de7\",\"quote\":\"The administrator of an individual account plan (other than a one-participant retirement plan described in section 1021(i)(8)(B) of this title)\",\"start\":102},{\"end\":251,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A9ede50be3469932d071153987e9d2b399c510cf2e3db7e8c7c8f05bf5e359184:246:251:sha256-56ee5b508706bf2de91712d85d6d1e11ddbff01949142ed6e8c22e3b1bed1c71\",\"quote\":\"shall\",\"start\":246}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:a009c170d4c133cefff29ed578f4dedc043c616914eacc2b6f35356cb76e8d18\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:f1f147b3f5704fdb4afb03f074a3af1be8e34ada826511a11637db11213c2135\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"shall\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:5ba13e9d4e2e327725eab110062eea80d85dcdbdc1bc2ff2743e1bfdbdd0a73a\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(A) Individual account plan The administrator of an individual account plan (other than a one-participant retirement plan described in section 1021(i)(8)(B) of this title) shall furnish a pension benefit statement—\\n\\n(i) at least once each calendar quarter to a participant or beneficiary who has the right to direct the investment of assets in his or her account under the plan,\\n\\n(ii) at least once each calendar year to a participant or beneficiary who has his or her own account under the plan but does not have the right to direct the investment of assets in that account, and\",\"references\":[\"section 1021(i)(8)(B) of this title\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:b6b30ca86945693d7303549731da1b78f888cc1ceadd18651383b936e29d8316\",\"scope_quotes\":[],\"scope_text\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":74,\"summary\":\"The administrator of an individual account plan (other than a one-participant retirement plan described in section 1021(i)(8)(B) of this title) shall furnish a pension benefit statement at least once each calendar year to a participant or beneficiary who has his or her own account under the plan but does not have the right to direct the investment of assets in that account.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
