rued, and\\n\\n(II) the nonforfeitable pension benefits, if any, which have accrued, or the earliest date on which benefits will become nonforfeitable,\",\"start\":1591},{\"end\":1529,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A9ede50be3469932d071153987e9d2b399c510cf2e3db7e8c7c8f05bf5e359184:1524:1529:sha256-56ee5b508706bf2de91712d85d6d1e11ddbff01949142ed6e8c22e3b1bed1c71\",\"quote\":\"shall\",\"start\":1524}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:69e0d5f445a558299c69065c21914aa514eb7f05d0aa17bf53717376e349959e\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:d7ca05c4eda9ddf951e0a77b3dd042567816dfba91e7bf1dacf6ae9d501cad75\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"shall\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:53904ca0034545f5722af150f340465adb5136c7d0eb08664bedbb7012396d9e\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(A) In general A pension benefit statement under paragraph (1)—\\n\\n(i) shall indicate, on the basis of the latest available information—\\n\\n(I) the total benefits accrued, and\\n\\n(II) the nonforfeitable pension benefits, if any, which have accrued, or the earliest date on which benefits will become nonforfeitable,\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:46946131a19dc725682485a4396f887bee99aebceb2db15021a71e09d75cdec4\",\"scope_quotes\":[],\"scope_text\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1455,\"summary\":\"A pension benefit statement under paragraph (1) shall indicate, on the basis of the latest available information, the total benefits accrued, and the nonforfeitable pension benefits, if any, which have accrued, or the earliest date on which benefits will become nonforfeitable.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
