        "@value": "{\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"summary\":\"In the case of an individual account plan, any pension benefit statement under clause (i) or (ii) of paragraph (1)(A) shall include the lifetime income disclosure described in subparagraph (D)(i).\"}",
