          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "In the case of pension benefit statements described in clause (i) of paragraph (1)(A), a lifetime income disclosure under clause (iii) of this subparagraph shall be required to be included in only one pension benefit statement during any one 12-month period."
        },
